  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total coupons&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>≤</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;selected coupon number <math> <mrow> <mo>≤</mo> <mn>9</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />i.e., <math><mn>1, 2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3, 4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5, 6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7, 8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Probability of one selected coupon to have number <math> <mrow> <mo>≤</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow> </math> <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>9</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Hence, the required probability<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mtext>....</mtext> <mn>7</mn> <mtext>&nbsp;times</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>7</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Using multiplicative principle for independent events)"
  }
